he rain-muted greenhouse ambience, freewheel tick, tire roll, footsteps, clothing movement, and a soft cardboard contact on wood without an acoustic restart.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nNo non-diegetic music.\",\n      \"length\": 362,\n      \"steps\": 20,\n      \"seed\": \"6102\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
